 *
 * Networks run Compact runtime 0.16.0 with toolchain 0.31.1 / language ~0.23.
 * The Compact runtime API reference currently documents 0.20.0 (ledger 9).
 * Symbols that appear only on 0.19.0 / 0.20.0 (for example JubJub Schnorr helpers)
 * are not present in 0.16.0 and must not be imported when targeting Preview,
 * Preprod, or Mainnet.
